WAR HAMMER. 

THREE TROOPS HAVE BEEN ORDERED INTO MLF/AMERICAN CONTROLLED
TERRITORY. YOUR MISSION IS TO NEUTRALIZE ENEMY IN-FIELD REFUEL 
DEPOT. 

1ST TROOP HAS BEEN INSTRUCTED TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 
224ø SOUTH BY SOUTH WEST. 2ND AND 3RD TROOPS HAVE INITIAL COURSE
HEADINGS OF 211ø AND 258ø RESPECTIVELY. 

3RD TROOP'S PRIMARY MISSION IS TO PROVIDE SECURITY FOR 1ST TROOP. 
2ND TROOP SHOULD ASSUME A RESERVE ROLE. BOTH UNITS ARE SANCTIONED 
TO COMPLETE 1ST TROOP'S MISSION OBJECTIVE SHOULD THE FORMER 
BECOME INOPERATIVE. 

BE ADVISED THAT ARTILLERY SUPPORT WILL BE DELAYED IN GETTING INTO 
POSITION. 

INTELLIGENCE REPORTS HAVE ALSO INDICATED THAT THE FIELD SURROUNDING 
YOUR TARGET ZONE HAS BEEN LADEN WITH MINES.
